This repository holds three kinds of code under three sets of terms.

CC0 1.0 (LICENSE.md) -- dedicated to the public domain by their authors:

  * the Star Fox 64 decompilation's code (src/, include/, srceu/, srcjp/,
    assets/, yamls/, linker_scripts/ and the decompilation's tools/), from
    https://github.com/sonicdcer/sf64;
  * the Dreamcast port's code and tools, from
    https://github.com/jnmartin84/sf64-dc, which is published under CC0.

MIT (below, Team Resurgent) -- the Xbox port's original work:

  * Platform/xbox/, except the KallistiOS code listed in NOTICE;
  * tools/xbox/, setup.py, rxdk.project.json, Star-Fox-64-X.sln,
    Star-Fox-64-X.vcxproj, Star-Fox-64-X.vcxproj.filters, .gitattributes,
    LICENSE, NOTICE, CONTRIBUTING.md, README.md, docs/ and .github/;
  * the Xbox port's changes marked XBOX: in the files under src/, include/
    and tools/.

KOS License (Platform/xbox/LICENSE.KOS) -- the KallistiOS code carried into
Platform/xbox/, listed in NOTICE.

The game itself is not covered by any of these. No ROM, asset or other game
data is distributed here; building needs your own legally obtained copy.

